OL,3,GNEWSAPolice launch new plan to tackle  
OL,4,A'parasite' of violence against women   
OL,6,FThe PSNI has said the new framework    
OL,7,Fbroadens its strategic focus to        
OL,8,Fexplicitly include children.           
